 "_doc": "Bergelmir (Vaf\u00fer\u00fa\u00f0nism\u00e1l 35; Gylfaginning 7: the one frost giant who lived through the flood of Ymir's blood, on his l\u00fa\u00f0r): a hulking frost giant with grey-blue skin, huge shoulders and a small head hunched between them, a heavy brow over pale glowing eyes, wild grey-white hair and a long rime-white beard hung with icicles; a shaggy fur mantle crusted with frost, a ragged fur kilt whose hem is dark with blood, fur-wrapped legs, and his long oar held upright beside him. Built by tools/art/build_abyss.py.",
